  "translation": "Na Mose i tokim Aharon, na tokim Elazar na tokim Itamar, ol pikinini bilong em: No ken pulapula ol het bilong yu, na no ken rutim ol klos bilong yu, sapos yu no ken dai, na no ken mekim bel he bilong olgeta lain i kamap; tasol ol brata bilong yu, olgeta haus bilong Yisrael, bai ol i krai long ⟨את⟩ paia bilong ol man i bin branim, we Yahwe i mekim.",
